s09d-other-org-create
s09d-other-org-create-request
OK
ok 1 - DEC-119 private table cms_capability_grants exists
ok 2 - DEC-119 private table cms_capability_grant_events exists
ok 3 - cms_capability_grants has ENABLE and FORCE row level security
ok 4 - cms_capability_grant_events has ENABLE and FORCE row level security
ok 5 - cms_capability_grants has no direct grant for anon, authenticated or service_role
ok 6 - cms_capability_grant_events has no direct grant for anon, authenticated or service_role
ok 7 - cms_capability_grants carries the typed aggregate columns
ok 8 - cms_capability_grant_events carries the typed event columns
ok 9 - the aggregate term CHECK allows at most 90 UTC days (valid_through - valid_from <= 89, DEC-120)
ok 10 - the aggregate ties state revoked to last_action revoked
ok 11 - UNIQUE(owner_id, subject_person_ref, capability_code)
ok 12 - UNIQUE(grant_id, aggregate_version) keys the append-only history
ok 13 - both tables carry a write guard and a state/immutability guard
ok 14 - platform_api.cms_grant_capability(jsonb) is executable by service_role only
ok 15 - platform_api.cms_renew_capability_grant(jsonb) is executable by service_role only
ok 16 - platform_api.cms_revoke_capability_grant(jsonb) is executable by service_role only
ok 17 - platform_api.cms_list_capability_grants(jsonb) is executable by service_role only
ok 18 - platform_private.cms_grant_capability(jsonb) is not directly executable by any role
ok 19 - platform_private.cms_renew_capability_grant(jsonb) is not directly executable by any role
ok 20 - platform_private.cms_revoke_capability_grant(jsonb) is not directly executable by any role
ok 21 - platform_private.cms_list_capability_grants(jsonb) is not directly executable by any role
ok 22 - all fifteen GrantableCmsCapability members are grantable
ok 23 - assignment-only, owner-only, read-only, admin, wildcard and unregistered keys are not grantable
ok 24 - the navigation and media members are added to the platform capability registry
ok 25 - every grantable member is a platform capability registry member
ok 26 - initialize_cms_owner leaves one version-1 granted aggregate per grantable owner capability
ok 27 - admin capabilities are never aggregated
ok 28 - a backfilled aggregate mirrors its actor-grant projection term exactly
ok 29 - a direct INSERT outside the RPC context is rejected
ok 30 - DELETE of an aggregate is rejected even inside the RPC context
ok 31 - the capability of an aggregate is immutable
ok 32 - the subject of an aggregate is immutable
1..32
ok
